      "bottomRightY": 198,
      "content": "# LEISURE",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 198,
      "bottomRightX": 357,
      "bottomRightY": 222,
      "content": "by William Henry Davies 1871-1940",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 235,
      "bottomRightX": 330,
      "bottomRightY": 273,
      "content": "What is this life if, full of care,\nWe have no time to stand and stare.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 287,
      "bottomRightX": 337,
      "bottomRightY": 325,
      "content": "No time to stand beneath the boughs\nAnd stare as long as sheep or cows.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 341,
      "bottomRightX": 356,
      "bottomRightY": 379,
      "content": "No time to see, when woods we pass,\nWhere squirrels hide their nuts in grass.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 395,
      "bottomRightX": 352,
      "bottomRightY": 431,
      "content": "No time to see, in broad daylight,\nStreams full of stars like skies at night.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 446,
      "bottomRightX": 363,
      "bottomRightY": 483,
      "content": "No time to turn at Beauty's glance,\nAnd watch her feet, how they can dance.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 499,
      "bottomRightX": 325,
      "bottomRightY": 537,
      "content": "No time to wait till her mouth can\nEnrich that smile her eyes began.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 116,
      "topLeftY": 552,
      "bottomRightX": 335,
      "bottomRightY": 590,
      "content": "A poor life this if, full of care,\nWe have no time to stand and stare.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 169,
      "topLeftY": 616,
      "bottomRightX": 348,
      "bottomRightY": 715,
      "content": "|  care | worry  |\n| --- | --- |\n|  stare | look closely  |\n|  boughs | branches  |\n|  squirrels | small animals  |\n|  broad daylight | full light of day  |\n|  streams | small rivers  |",
      "type": "table",
      "tableId": null
    },
    {
